---
layout: base.njk
title: "Partners: ECO-BRIDGE KAWEMPE"
description: "Who ECO-BRIDGE KAWEMPE works with: KCCA, Local Council leaders, schools, NEMA, and the communities of Kawempe Division."
permalink: /partners/
trustbar:
  - label: "Named partners"
    value: "5"
  - label: "Area"
    value: "Kawempe Division, Kampala"
---
<section style="padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label">Who we work with</span>
    <h1>Partners</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="color:var(--color-text-muted); max-width:64ch;">{{ partners.intro }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ledger">
      {% for p in partners.list %}
      <div class="ledger-entry" style="animation-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 40 }}ms">
        <span class="field">{{ p.name }}</span>
        <span class="value" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1rem;">{{ p.role }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="label">Want to partner with us</span>
      <h3 style="margin-top:var(--space-sm); color:var(--color-text)">We're always open to genuine collaboration in Kawempe Division</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0">If your school, organization, or agency wants to work with us on environmental conservation, WASH, or youth livelihoods, get in touch.</p>
      <div class="button-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-md)">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
